# per-track JSON, combined.json, and old .txt/.vtt/.wav exports) stays local.
meetings/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]/**
!meetings/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]/**/
!meetings/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]/**/transcripts/combined.md
!meetings/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]/**/notes/summary.md
